              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 4:27–31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mutu mmwenga achihenda dambi bila kumanya, ni arehe sadaka ya mvarika wa mwaka mmwenga ikale sadaka ya kuusa dambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlavyadzi-sadaka andampatanisha na Mwenyezi Mlungu ye mutu achiyehenda dambi, na kpwa kuhenda hivyo ye mutu andaswamehewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundakala na shariya mwenga ndiyohumika kpwa yeyesi ndiyehenda dambi bila kumanya, akale ni Muiziraeli mwenyezi au ni mjeni asagalaye phamwenga namwi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ela mutu yeyesi ndiyehenda dambi kusudi, akale Muiziraeli au mjeni, anamkufuru Mwenyezi Mlungu, naye ni atengbwe na atue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu dza hiye ni atengbwe tsetsetse na atsukule lawama ra uyiwe, kpwa sababu akabera neno ra Mwenyezi Mlungu na kuvundza amurize.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku mwenga Aiziraeli ariphokala achere weruni aona mutu anatsola-tsola kuni Siku ya Kuoya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hara ariomuona amreha kpwa Musa, Aruni na Aiziraeli osi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao achimtiya chifungoni mana kala taamanya ra kumuhenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Mwenyezi Mlungu achigomba na Musa achimuamba, “Mutu iye ni aolagbwe. Atu osi ni ampige mawe kondze ya mudzi hadi afwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi nyo atu osi amtuluza kondze ya yo kambi na achimpiga mawe hadi achifwa, dza Mwenyezi Mlungu arivyomlagiza Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achigomba na Musa achimuamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.22.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 22:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gomba na Aiziraeli na uaambe adzisukire midzele kpwenye michindo ya mavwazi gao kahi za vivyazi vyao vyosi. Chila mdzele ukale na wuuzi wa rangi ya buluu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Midzele hino mundakala nayo ili ndiphoilola mtambukire na kulunga malagizo gosi ga Mwenyezi Mlungu, sedze mkakosa kuhenda uaminifu kpwa kulunga tamaa za mioyo yenu na matso genu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo midzele indakuhendani mtambukire na mlunge amuri zangu zosi, namwi mundakala atakatifu kpwa Mlungu wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, niriyekutuluzani Misiri, kpwa nikale Mlungu wenu. Mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
